# The shell toolchain, pinned once for every project that owns shell
# (`.tool-versions` format: one tool and exactly one version per line).
# scripts/shell-tools.sh is the only reader: `just bootstrap` (and so CI)
# installs these exact versions, and every format, lint and coverage target
# runs them through it, refusing any other. Kept out of `.tool-versions`, which
# pins `just` alone for asdf/mise, because kcov has no asdf/mise plugin.
shellcheck 0.11.0
shfmt 3.14.1
kcov 43
